# Trivy ignore file — SecurityScarletAI (P3.5)
#
# Every entry here is an ACCEPTED RISK and must carry:
#   1. the CVE/GHSA ID
#   2. a rationale (why it does not block shipping)
#   3. a date, so stale accepts get re-reviewed
#
# Entries without a rationale are a policy violation — do not add them.
#
# As of Phase 3 (2026-09-02) no accepts exist yet: this file ships empty of
# CVEs on purpose. The first CI runs of the trivy-image-scan job will surface
# real findings; each gets triaged into (a) fix via base-image/dependency
# bump, or (b) a rationale'd entry here. Nothing is wave-through by default.